integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, bathed in warm, late-afternoon sunlight streaming through large windows. A young woman sits comfortably in a woven chair, wearing a light blue traditional-style blouse with delicate embroidery and loose white pants. Starting in a relaxed state, she slowly raises a bright red Coke can to her lips, her expression neutral but focused. As she sips, the camera gently tilts and pans slightly left to reveal more of the golden light highlighting her delicate facial features, faint wisps of hair glowing in the sun. Mid-action, she pauses, visibly frowning, and seems to reconsider the taste. Her eyes dart slightly to the side as the frown morphs into a mischievous grin. Abruptly, she shifts forward in the chair and extends her hand forcefully, throwing the nearly full can to the right, out of frame. The splashing sound of liquid is faintly heard as she leans forward, her face breaking into an exaggerated, amused smile—wide-eyed and gleeful. The shot ends with her sitting upright and beaming amidst the glowing warm sunlight as her laughter blends seamlessly into the cheerful non-diegetic music.

overall_soundscape: Gentle city noise in the background, with the distant sound of a bird chirping. The crisp hiss of the can opening is audible, followed by the sound of soda being sipped. The can hits the ground off-screen with a muffled thud and a splash, followed by playful, infectious laughter.

non_diegetic_music: A lively instrumental track with upbeat acoustic guitar riffs, punctuated by cheerful claps and tambourine jingles, begins softly but crescendos as the can is thrown, sustaining its vibrant rhythm until the end of the shot.
